nodes.body:
@jeejeelee, gently nudging on this one.

It is test-only, so no rush from a correctness standpoint, but it may be worth a few minutes because **#49063 is still open.** The bug it reports no longer reproduces on `main`, so that issue is currently in the awkward state of being open with nothing to fix. This test is the guard that would let it be closed on purpose. It asserts the property the fix relies on, that a request carrying no adapter gets an exactly-zero LoRA delta.

Happy to change the approach or drop it if you would rather not carry another kernel test.

